==Havering council elections since 2022==
There was a revision of ward boundaries in Havering in 2022. South Hornchurch lost territory in the south to [[Rainham and Wennington (ward)|Rainham and Wennington]] and the new ward of [[Beam Park (ward)|Beam Park]]. The number of councillors representing the ward was reduced from three to two. 

